The CYTO7 Authors

cyto7 is an open, vertex-level cortical type atlas of the human cortex.
This file lists the individuals and institutions holding copyright in the atlas
products and in the analysis code released in this repository.

Individuals
  Ricardo Salvador
  Borja Mercadal
  Francesca Castaldo
  Miguel Angel Garcia-Cabezas
  Giulio Ruffini

Institutions
  Neuroelectrics Barcelona, Barcelona, Spain
  Barcelona Computational Foundation (BCOM), Barcelona, Spain
  Department of Anatomy, Histology and Neuroscience, School of Medicine,
    Universidad Autonoma de Madrid, Madrid, Spain
  Neural Systems Laboratory, Department of Health Sciences, Boston University,
    Boston, MA, USA

Licences
  Code: MIT (see LICENSE-CODE)
  Data: CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA)

Third-party data
  No third-party data is redistributed here. The validation analyses used the
  Human Connectome Project, ENIGMA, the Allen Human Brain Atlas, the Hansen PET
  collection and BigBrain. Each remains available from its original provider
  under that provider's own terms.
